    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Square Game is an idle/incremental game about a square bouncing around a box and collecting dots! You use those dots in order to purchase and upgrade a miner. That miner will collect ore that you can use to upgrade your square! If you collect enough dots, you can eventually prestige getting upgrades that will increase progression exponentially!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:\u00a0<br><br>- Idle gameplay<br><br>- Many Upgrades<br><br>- Prestige System<br><br>- Deck building<br><br>- Settings Menu<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696110/extras/61aff9cf93b5460159c532b2b229c3e3.poster.avif?t=1752785520\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696110/extras/61aff9cf93b5460159c532b2b229c3e3.webm?t=1752785520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696110/extras/61aff9cf93b5460159c532b2b229c3e3.mp4?t=1752785520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Square Game is an idle/incremental game about a square bouncing around a box and collecting dots! You use those dots in order to purchase and upgrade a miner. That miner will collect ore that you can use to upgrade your square! If you collect enough dots, you can eventually prestige getting upgrades that will increase progression exponentially!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:\u00a0<br><br>- Idle gameplay<br><br>- Many Upgrades<br><br>- Prestige System<br><br>- Deck building<br><br>- Settings Menu<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696110/extras/61aff9cf93b5460159c532b2b229c3e3.poster.avif?t=1752785520\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696110/extras/61aff9cf93b5460159c532b2b229c3e3.webm?t=1752785520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696110/extras/61aff9cf93b5460159c532b2b229c3e3.mp4?t=1752785520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
